OL,3,ALucy Letby hospital could have
OL,4,Aprevented some baby deaths, inquiry
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FLetby is serving 15 whole-life prison
OL,8,Fterms for murdering seven babies and
OL,9,Fattempting to murder seven more. She
OL,10,Fwas convicted in 2023 and has been
OL,11,Fdenied permission to appeal against her
OL,12,Fconvictions twice
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
