OL,4,AAwards history with double win
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are a small but mighty nation. This
OL,7,Fis incredible," he said, adding "Diolch
OL,8,Fyn fawr iawn" - which means "thank you
OL,9,Fvery much" in Welsh.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
